{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "%@, %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@，%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A directly resolved address answered. LocalDevVPN may not be needed for this hop — worth confirming with a full session before relying on it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有直接解析出的位址回應了。這一跳可能不需要 LocalDevVPN——但在真正依賴它之前，建議先用完整的工作階段確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer public release is available: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有可用的新版公開發行版本：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A random identifier is created for this installation and irreversibly hashed before it is sent. It is used only to estimate activity from participating installations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統會為這次安裝建立一個隨機識別碼，並在傳送前經過不可逆的雜湊處理。它只用於估算參與安裝的活動量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real iPhone is required to start a location session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要實體 iPhone 才能啟動定位工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A resolved address and loopback both answered. The service is not refusing local connections, so LocalDevVPN may not be needed for this hop. Confirm with a full session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析出的位址與本機回送都有回應。這項服務並未拒絕本機連線，因此這一跳可能不需要 LocalDevVPN。請用完整的工作階段確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A resolved address answered but loopback did not. The service wants a real interface address, not loopback — LocalDevVPN may not be needed for this hop, but a routable address is. Confirm with a full session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析出的位址有回應，但本機回送沒有。這項服務需要真實的介面位址而非回送位址——這一跳可能不需要 LocalDevVPN，但需要一個可路由的位址。請用完整的工作階段確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
