    "Another VPN may affect local device connections. If it is appropriate for your network, compare a test with that VPN paused. Keep LocalDevVPN enabled when starting a location session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他 VPN 可能影響本機裝置連線。若你的網路環境允許，可以暫停該 VPN 再測試比較。啟動定位工作階段時請保持 LocalDevVPN 啟用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
