    "Checks the public GitHub release only when you tap it. Roam Control never sends location, pairing or diagnostic data with this request.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在你點選時才會檢查公開的 GitHub 版本。Sprout 不會在這個請求中傳送位置、配對或診斷資料。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks the public GitHub release only when you tap it. Sprout never sends location, pairing or diagnostic data with this request."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks whether this iPhone's pairing service answers on the addresses Bonjour resolved, instead of only through LocalDevVPN. It opens a TCP connection and closes it without sending anything, and never starts, changes or stops a location session. The result includes local network addresses, so review it before sharing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檢查這支 iPhone 的配對服務是否能在 Bonjour 解析出的位址上回應，而不是只能透過 LocalDevVPN。它只會開啟一個 TCP 連線並立即關閉，不會傳送任何內容，也絕不會啟動、變更或停止定位工作階段。結果包含區域網路位址，分享前請先確認內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
