    "Events are sent to Roam Control's maintainer-operated service and, in configured beta builds, TelemetryDeck. The self-hosted service receives ordinary HTTPS connection metadata, such as the source IP address, but the app does not include it in the event body.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事件會傳送到由 Sprout 維護者營運的服務，在有設定的 Beta 版本中也會傳送到 TelemetryDeck。自架服務會收到一般的 HTTPS 連線中繼資料（例如來源 IP 位址），但 App 不會把它放進事件內容中。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Events are sent to Sprout's maintainer-operated service and, in configured beta builds, TelemetryDeck. The self-hosted service receives ordinary HTTPS connection metadata, such as the source IP address, but the app does not include it in the event body."
          }
        }
      }
    },
