        }
      }
    },
    "The secure location session is ready. You can restore mobile data now; spoofing will continue over 5G.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全的定位工作階段已就緒。你現在可以恢復行動網路，模擬定位會繼續透過 5G 運作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The self-hosted service runs daily maintenance that deletes live events older than 90 days. No fixed deletion schedule is promised for database backups or web-server access logs. TelemetryDeck says it does not store IP addresses and may retain anonymous events for roughly 7–10 years without guaranteeing an exact deletion date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自架服務每天執行維護作業，刪除超過 90 天的即時事件。資料庫備份與網頁伺服器存取紀錄則未承諾固定的刪除排程。TelemetryDeck 表示不會儲存 IP 位址，並可能保留匿名事件約 7 至 10 年，且不保證確切的刪除日期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
